# SOS — Backend API (always read before API work)

## Canonical sources (read in this order)

1. **`docs/SOS_BACKEND_API_REFERENCE.md`** — **Machine-readable catalog**: every Hoppscotch-exported route with method, path, auth, content-type, request/cURL samples, multipart fields, **integration status** (`integrated` / `partial` / `not_integrated`), and **app-only** routes (`refresh-token`, payments, outfits).
2. **`docs/completeAPIDocumentation.html`** — Offline Hoppscotch **Mobile API V1** export; refresh when the live collection changes.
3. **`docs/API_INTEGRATION_GUIDE.md`** — Plain-English **screen → service → flow**, FAQ, flowcharts.

Online viewer (may require login): `https://api.styleonspot.com/view/f2fb9ef4-e921-404c-949d-4daf9f445155/CURRENT`

**Rule:** Do not guess paths, field names, or auth. If `SOS_BACKEND_API_REFERENCE.md` and code disagree, trust **live backend + HTML export**, then update the MD file.

---

## Global contract (short)

| Topic | Detail |
|-------|--------|
| **Base URL** | `EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL` = `https://app.styleonspot.com/api/v1` (no duplicate `/v1` in `endpoints.ts` paths). |
| **Public JSON** | `POST /auth/send-otp` `{ phone }`; `POST /auth/verify-otp` `{ phone, otp, name? }` — no Bearer. |
| **Bearer** | `Authorization: Bearer <access_token>` on all other app calls unless noted. |
| **Refresh** | `POST /auth/refresh-token` with refresh token body — **`apiClient`** only; often missing from static HTML export. |
| **Envelope** | Typical `{ success, data, message }` — unwrap in `services/*`; errors → `ApiError` (`errors.ts`). |
| **Multipart** | Onboarding + wardrobe items use **FormData**; field names are listed in **`SOS_BACKEND_API_REFERENCE.md` §6** and per-endpoint sections. |

