## Where the app stands (summary)

| Area | Integrated | Partial / not wired |
|------|------------|---------------------|
| **Auth** | Send OTP, verify OTP, resend (with fallback), logout | — |
| **Token** | Refresh on 401 in `client.ts` | — |
| **Onboarding** | status, profile image, full body, basic details, body shape, skin-tone-style, complete | **`GET /onboarding/options`** (no UI call) |
| **Profile** | `GET`/`PUT /profile`, legacy `POST /users/me/profile-setup` | — |
| **Wardrobe folders** | list, get, create, update, delete | **`POST /wardrobe/folders/reorder`** |
| **Wardrobe items** | CRUD, list by folder, item image upload | **`GET /wardrobe/search`** (service only; **WardrobeFiltersScreen** UI not calling API), **bulk-delete**, **track-usage**, **analytics**, **items-usage**\* |
| **Outfits** | `wardrobeService` outfits + saved | May 404 if not deployed |
| **Virtual try-on** | initiate, poll, delete, react, rate, regenerate, lookbook, schedule | **`GET /virtual-tryon` list** (no history UI) |
| **Sessions** | — | **`GET /sessions`**, **`DELETE /sessions/:id`** (doc only) |
| **Payments** | `paymentService` methods exist | **Checkout UI** not fully wired to payment POSTs |

\*Usage/analytics paths appear in the HTML export — see **`docs/SOS_BACKEND_API_REFERENCE.md`** for exact paths.

