## When you change the backend or routes

1. Update **`docs/completeAPIDocumentation.html`** (re-export Hoppscotch) when the collection changes.
2. Regenerate or hand-edit **`docs/SOS_BACKEND_API_REFERENCE.md`** so it stays the **single** deep spec.
3. Adjust **`endpoints.ts`** + **`services/*`** + screens.
4. Update **`docs/API_INTEGRATION_GUIDE.md`** (flows) and **`memory.md`** if behavior is user-visible.
